            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="30f2-be70-861d-1b84">This model has a transport capacity of 22 **^^Orks Infantry^^** models. If this model is equipped with a killkannon, it has a transport capacity of 12 **^^Orks Infantry^^** models. Each **^^Mega Armour^^** or **^^Jump Pack^^** model takes up the space of 2 models.</characteristic>
