            <characteristic name="Description" id="29f1-7e02-d0c0-de81" hidden="false" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time an attack targets this unit, if it contains one or more Gretchin models, until that attack is resolved, Runtherd models in this unit have a Toughness characteristic of 2.</characteristic>
