          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" id="f729-7502-93d4-d57" hidden="false" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks made with a rivet kannon. Until the start of your next turn, that enemy unit is suppressed. While a unit is suppressed, each time a model in that unit makes a ranged attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</characteristic>
