        <profile name="Roar of Mork (Psychic)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="be60-8268-2c46-1fa7">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your opponent’s Command phase, you can select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this **^^Psyker^^** and roll one D6: on a 1, this **^^Psyker^^** suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 2+, until the start of your opponent’s next Command phase, that enemy unit is confrazzled. While a unit is confrazzled, each time a Battle-shock or Leadership test is taken for it, subtract 2 from that test.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
