            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time a ranged attack is allocated to an **^^ORKS^^** model from your army, if that model is not fully visible to every model in the attacking unit because of this **^^DEFF ROLLA BATTLE FORTRESS^^** model, that model has the Benefit of Cover against that attack.</characteristic>
