                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^WARBOSS^^** model only. In your Command phase, you can select one **^^NOBZ^^** or **^^MEGANOBZ^^** unit from your army (excluding Battle-shocked units) that is within 6&quot; of the bearer and is within range of an objective marker. If there are no enemy models within range of that objective marker, it is Secured by your army.</characteristic>
